# Code ownership and the approval rule.
#
# Every Merge Request needs one peer and one lead. GitLab reads this file for
# the "Code Owners" approval rule; set the rule to require approval from code
# owners and the number of approvals to two in the project settings.
#
# Replace the placeholders with GitLab usernames or groups.

*                       @__LEAD__ @__TEAM_GROUP__

# The standard itself: any change to how agents and CI behave needs the lead.
/AGENTS.md              @__LEAD__
/CLAUDE.md              @__LEAD__
/.claude/               @__LEAD__
/.githooks/             @__LEAD__
/.gitlab-ci.yml         @__LEAD__
/.gitlab/               @__LEAD__
/CODEOWNERS             @__LEAD__
/SECURITY.md            @__LEAD__

# Boundaries get a second look.
/**/migrations/         @__LEAD__
/docs/adr/              @__LEAD__
